THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS: none bundled.

The harness and the website have no runtime third-party dependencies. The
website ships no external scripts, stylesheets, fonts, analytics or trackers.

Optional development/acceleration tools, not bundled and not required:
  - cryptography (Apache-2.0 OR BSD-3-Clause) — optional Ed25519 acceleration.
    A vendored pure-Python RFC 8032 implementation is used when it is absent,
    so no verification path depends on it.
  - playwright (Apache-2.0) — development-only screenshot review.

The Ed25519 fallback in aliaswatch/log.py is an original implementation of
RFC 8032 written for this project.

If a dependency is ever added, its licence must be recorded here in the same
commit that adds it.
